{"id":"c0486b96e648a9d6","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-bqp.md","title":"Bounded-Error Quantum Polynomial Time","display":"df-bqp — Bounded-Error Quantum Polynomial Time","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-bqp","aliases":["28-df-bqp","BQP"],"display":"df-bqp — Bounded-Error Quantum Polynomial Time","depends_on":["[[28-df-quantum-circuit]]","[[28-df-measurement]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 10.9 and remarks; §10.3.8","source_printed_pages":"213–216","source_pdf_pages":"239–242","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-bqp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-bqp</span><span>BQP</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bqp — Bounded-Error Quantum Polynomial Time"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4588e429e73283a\" href=\"?note=b4588e429e73283a\" title=\"28-df-quantum-circuit\">28-df-quantum-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5f1a82cfa5790c35\" href=\"?note=5f1a82cfa5790c35\" title=\"28-df-measurement\">28-df-measurement</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 10.9 and remarks; §10.3.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"213–216"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"239–242"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\">\\(\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QU}\">\\(\\operatorname{QU}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Out}\">\\(\\operatorname{Out}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4588e429e73283a\" href=\"?note=b4588e429e73283a\" title=\"28-df-quantum-circuit\">28-df-quantum-circuit</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{\\mathsf{acc},m}\">\\(E_{\\mathsf{acc},m}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5f1a82cfa5790c35\" href=\"?note=5f1a82cfa5790c35\" title=\"28-df-measurement\">28-df-measurement</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\">\\(a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(n)=n+a(n)\\ge1\">\\(m(n)=n+a(n)\\ge1\\)</span>；输入态采用下式的零辅助比特初始化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{x,a}\">\\(\\rho_{x,a}\\)</span> 与接受概率只对当前绑定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,\\mathcal C\">\\(a,\\mathcal C\\)</span> 及其合法输入定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(n)\">\\(m(n)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+a(n)\">\\(n+a(n)\\)</span> 的局部缩写。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{x,a}\\coloneqq|x0^{a(|x|)}\\rangle\\langle x0^{a(|x|)}|,\\qquad \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal C,a}(x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Tr}(E_{\\mathsf{acc},m(|x|)}\\operatorname{Out}_{C_{|x|}}(\\rho_{x,a})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{x,a}\\coloneqq|x0^{a(|x|)}\\rangle\\langle x0^{a(|x|)}|,\\qquad \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal C,a}(x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Tr}(E_{\\mathsf{acc},m(|x|)}\\operatorname{Out}_{C_{|x|}}(\\rho_{x,a})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{BQP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\ \\exists\\mathcal C=(C_n)_n\\ [&amp;\\operatorname{QU}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (n+a(n)\\ge1\\land C_n\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_{n+a(n)}\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le p(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal C,a}(x)\\ge2/3\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal C,a}(x)\\le1/3]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{BQP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\ \\exists\\mathcal C=(C_n)_n\\ [&amp;\\operatorname{QU}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (n+a(n)\\ge1\\land C_n\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_{n+a(n)}\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le p(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal C,a}(x)\\ge2/3\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal C,a}(x)\\le1/3]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>有限有效门库、经典多项式时间统一性、辅助比特数、输出线路和误差都在前两节绑定。恒定间隙可放大；统一性不能只写在变量的直观解释里。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 10.9 and remarks; §10.3.8，印刷页 213–216；PDF 页 239–242。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-quantum-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"b4588e429e73283a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-quantum-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-measurement","status":"resolved","id":"5f1a82cfa5790c35","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-measurement]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantum-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"b4588e429e73283a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$\\operatorname{QU}$、$\\operatorname{Out}$、$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-circuit]]；$E_{\\mathsf{acc},m}$ 见 [[28-df-measurement]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-measurement","status":"resolved","id":"5f1a82cfa5790c35","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$\\operatorname{QU}$、$\\operatorname{Out}$、$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-circuit]]；$E_{\\mathsf{acc},m}$ 见 [[28-df-measurement]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{QCirc}_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QU}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Out}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"E_{\\mathsf{acc},m}","display":false},{"tex":"a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]","display":false},{"tex":"m(n)=n+a(n)\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_{x,a}","display":false},{"tex":"a,\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"m(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n+a(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_{x,a}\\coloneqq|x0^{a(|x|)}\\rangle\\langle x0^{a(|x|)}|,\\qquad \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal C,a}(x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Tr}(E_{\\mathsf{acc},m(|x|)}\\operatorname{Out}_{C_{|x|}}(\\rho_{x,a})).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{BQP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\ \\exists\\mathcal C=(C_n)_n\\ [&\\operatorname{QU}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (n+a(n)\\ge1\\land C_n\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_{n+a(n)}\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le p(n))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal C,a}(x)\\ge2/3\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal C,a}(x)\\le1/3]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2058,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"复杂性类：[[28-df-bqp]]、[[28-df-qma]]、[[28-thm-bqp-contained-pspace]]。"},{"id":"c590fb7eaa58168d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BQP}$ 采用 [[28-df-bqp]] 的有限有效门库与经典多项式时间统一性；$\\mathbf{PSPACE}$ 见 [[28-df-pspace]]。"},{"id":"9a7e2d6d7ea972c3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{BQP}$、$\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$\\operatorname{Out}_C$、$\\operatorname{QU}$ 见 [[28-df-bqp]]、[[28-df-quantum-circuit]]；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]，$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]。\n$\\operatorname{bin}(N)$ 为正整数 $N$ 的无前导零二进制表示，$\\mathbb N[n]$ 是非负整数系数一元多项式集合；空乘积取 $1$。$C\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$x\\in\\Sigma^{\\le m}$；$\\operatorname{QOut}_C(x)$ 是值域 $\\Sigma^m$ 的随机变量，其概率质量由下式定义。\n$\\operatorname{Prime}$、正整数对序列集合 $\\mathcal T$、质因数分解关系 $\\mathsf{PF}$ 及列表编码 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{pf}}$ 均在下式内定义。$\\mathcal V=(V_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$，$G\\in\\mathbf{FP}$ 为确定型测量后处理算法；字串乘积按序拼接。"}],"outgoing":["b4588e429e73283a","5f1a82cfa5790c35"]}